<title>HUNGARY: CESI SHARE INDEX EDGES DOWN TO END AT 1,547.06 PTS.</title>
<headline>CESI SHARE INDEX EDGES DOWN TO END AT 1,547.06 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index weakened on Wednesday falling to 1,547.06 points, down 5.53 points or 0.36 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
